<title>USA: Texas Industries silent on stock activity.</title>
<headline>Texas Industries silent on stock activity.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Texas Industries Inc has declined to comment on the activity in its stock, the New York Stock Exchange said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The stock was down 3-3/8 at 59 in late trade.</p>
<p>The exchange said it had asked the company to issue a public statement to explain whether there were any developments that might have prompted the stock's behavior.</p>
<p>&quot;(But) the company stated that its policy is not to comment on unusual market activity or rumors,&quot; it said.</p>
</text>
